@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Hiragino Sans"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
title E37：予定時刻からの経過分（予定 = 満潮 - 30 分、4 分遅れて受け入れ）

concise "受け入れ" as S
concise "pump（出力意図）" as P

@0
S is "開：[予定, 予定+10 分)"
P is "false"

@4
P is "受け入れから 5 分間実行"

@9
P is "false"

@10
S is "閉（終端は含まない）"

S@0 <-> @10 : within(10min)
P@4 <-> @9 : run(5min)
@enduml
